  shape   callsQueueEntryFull
}

/// The queueEntry rows of one parent, for the calls integration: queue entries of one room -- bounded by the queue entry lifetime and the join rate of the calls policy. actor.userId scoping is not the fix: the calls integration runs as the site owner or the cluster, so a caller term would decide nothing, and what @serverOnly withholds is the WIRE.
@serverOnly
